!anim left_left text Expr({{color=orange|1}})
!anim left_left color emp
[explain] @(84, 653) {$note} First subtract: 2 − 1 = 1.
...
!anim left_root text Expr({{color=orange|2}})
!anim left_start text Start({{color=orange|2}})
!anim explain text Then add: 1 + 1 = {{color=emp|2}}.
...
!anim right_right text Expr({{color=orange|2}})
!anim right_right color neon_pink
!anim explain text For the other tree, first add: 1 + 1 = 2.
...
!anim right_root text Expr({{color=orange|0}})
!anim right_start text Start({{color=orange|0}})
!anim explain text Then subtract: 2 − 2 = {{color=neon_pink|0}}. Same tokens, different meanings!
