% PowerPoint slides 8.
### Precedence Violations
[intro] @(84, 180) {$body, w=590px} Left association alone is not enough.
...
[expr] @(84, 275) {$body, w=590px, size=44px} `2 - 3 * 4`
...
[wrong] @(84, 364) {$body, w=590px} All operators at one level give{{br}}`(2 - 3) * 4` = {{color=neon_pink|−4}}.
...
[want] @(84, 485) {$body, w=590px} We want `2 - (3 * 4)` = {{color=emp|−10}}.
